<h3>二、Finding Details</h3>

<p><b>ASLAMO-1: Process Capability Decline (CanEl &lt; 1.00)</b></p>
<p>Your statistical process control (SPC) data for Q3 2026 shows a process capability index (<b>CanEl</b>) of <b>0.82</b> for the enclosure sealing process (specification: CanEl ≥ 1.33). This means the process is <b>not capable</b> of consistently producing parts within specification:</p>

<table cellpadding=5 style="border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #ccc;width:100%">
<tr style="background:#f0f0f0"><th>Metric</th><th>Specification</th><th>Q2 2026</th><th>Q3 2026</th><th>Trend</th></tr>
<tr><td>CanEl (Sealing)</td><td>≥ 1.33</td><td>1.41</td><td style="color:#e00"><b>0.82</b></td><td>▼ -42%</td></tr>
<tr><td>Cpk (Machining)</td><td>≥ 1.33</td><td>1.52</td><td>1.38</td><td>▼ -9%</td></tr>
<tr><td>PPM Defects</td><td>&lt; 500</td><td>420</td><td style="color:#e00"><b>1,840</b></td><td>▲ +338%</td></tr>
<tr><td>Escape Rate</td><td>&lt; 0.1%</td><td>0.08%</td><td style="color:#e00"><b>0.34%</b></td><td>▲ +325%</td></tr>
</table>

<p><b>Root Cause (preliminary):</b> The sealing process operator training was not updated when Boeing revised sealing specification <b>BSS-7420 Rev D</b> in June 2026. 14 of 22 operators are working to the obsolete Rev C.</p>

